{"id": "90000043", "name": "פרמטרים שעבורם (x−r)² מחלק פולינום – שורש כפול", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתון הפולינום</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ P(x)={{CT:0}}+ax^2+bx[[if test=\"{{CT:3}}\"]]+{{CT:1}}[[else]]{{CT:1}}[[/if]] \\]</p><p>כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b\\)</span> מספרים ממשיים.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a\\)</span> ואת <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b\\)</span> כך ש-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span> יחלק את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(x)\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(a=\\) [[input:ans1]]&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(b=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((x-r)^2\\)</span> מחלק את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span> בדיוק כאשר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(r\\)</span> שורש כפול: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(r)=0\\)</span> וגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P'(r)=0\\)</span>. אלה שתי משוואות לינאריות ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — למה שורש כפול</b><br>אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(x)=(x-r)^2S(x)\\)</span> אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P'(x)=2(x-r)S(x)+(x-r)^2S'(x)\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(r)=P'(r)=0\\)</span>. ולהפך: אם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(r)=0\\)</span> אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(x)=(x-r)T(x)\\)</span>, ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P'(r)=T(r)\\)</span>; אם גם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P'(r)=0\\)</span> אז <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((x-r)\\)</span> מחלק את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(T\\)</span>. כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(r={{CT:4}}\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — המשוואות</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ P({{CT:4}})=0:\\quad {{CT:5}}a+({{CT:4}})b={{CT:6}} \\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ P'(x)={{CT:7}}+2ax+b,\\qquad P'({{CT:4}})=0:\\quad {{CT:8}}a+b={{CT:9}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — פתרון</b><br>מהמשוואה השנייה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(b={{CT:9}}-({{CT:8}})a\\)</span>. מציבים בראשונה ומקבלים<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ a={{CT:10}},\\qquad b={{CT:11}}. \\]</p>בדיקה: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P(x)={{CT:12}}={{CT:2}}\\left({{CT:13}}\\right)\\)</span>.</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 6, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "[ans1,ans2]", "tans": "[A,B]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-0-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "r^4+c3*r^3+ans1*r^2+ans2*r+c0", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">עם הערכים שלכם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P({{CT:4}})=0\\)</span>, כלומר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:14}}\\)</span> מחלק את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P\\)</span>, אבל השורש אינו כפול. צריך גם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P'({{CT:4}})=0\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">עם הערכים שלכם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P({{CT:4}})\\ne 0\\)</span>. היעזרו בשני התנאים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P({{CT:4}})=0\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(P'({{CT:4}})=0\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["A", "B", "P", "c0", "c3", "dhead", "e1", "e2", "head", "r", "s", "t"], "nvariants": 50}